  'You perform one final timing correction for a short narration.',
  'Return only JSON with one key named narrations containing exactly ' +
    rows.length + ' strings.',
  'The immutable original_narration is the factual meaning source. current_narration is only an unaccepted timing draft.',
  'Do not add new facts. Preserve original subjects, actions, required objects and causal direction.',
  'Do not change any visual or evidence fields because they are not part of this response.',
].join(' ');

